<package name="bugwarden" project="openSUSE:Factory">
  <title>MCP server for Bugzilla with operator-controlled security guards</title>
  <description>bugwarden exposes Bugzilla to MCP clients (LLM tooling) through a guard
policy that the client can neither see nor change. The policy is read once at
startup from a TOML file and decides, per bug, which capabilities a client is
granted.</description>
</package>
